    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d80">

                <pb facs="0243" n="115" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg115"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 80.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Whitehouse to Mr.
                            Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States in Central America</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">La Libertad</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1885-04-18"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >April</hi> 18, 1885</date>. (Received May 16.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: On the 17th instant I sent you the
                    following cablegram: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Government of Salvador decrees national vote of thanks to diplomatic
                            corps for efficacious intervention to promote peace.</p></quote></p>
                <p>I am now able to inclose a copy of the decree, from article 4 of which I quoted
                    in the above-mentioned cablegram.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>H. REMSEN WHITEHOUSE.</signed></closer>




